  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"account-page\"><div class=\"account-card\"><div class=\"account-intro\"><span class=\"account-label\">Common Ground</span><h1>Good conversations.<br/><span class=\"text-sun\">Common ground.</span></h1><p>A place to ask, listen and learn from one another. Bring your curiosity. There’s room for your perspective.</p><div aria-label=\"Common Ground: perspectives coming together\" class=\"ground-art\" data-depth-scene=\"\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ground-orbit\"></div>\n<figure class=\"ground-window\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of a tropical food forest\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of a tropical food forest\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2528\"/></noscript></figure>\n<div class=\"ground-note note-listen\"><span>01 / LISTEN</span><strong>Every perspective<br/>starts somewhere.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ground-note note-share\"><span>02 / SHARE</span><strong>What are you<br/>noticing?</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</i></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ground-seed\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-1199.webp 1199w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1312\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1199\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1312\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/plumeria-bloom-ff5a4c80143e-1199.webp 1199w\" width=\"1199\"/></noscript></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"account-side\"><h2>Find your way back in.</h2><p class=\"account-lede\">Type the email you joined with, and a link to reset your password is sent to that inbox.</p><form class=\"account-form\" data-live-auth=\"recover\"><div class=\"account-field\"><label for=\"rc-email\">Email</label><input aria-describedby=\"rc-email-error\" autocomplete=\"email\" data-required=\"Type your email first.\" id=\"rc-email\" inputmode=\"email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/><p class=\"field-error\" data-error-for=\"rc-email\" hidden=\"\" id=\"rc-email-error\"></p></div><button class=\"account-submit\" type=\"submit\"><span>Send reset link</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></button><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-status\" data-form-status=\"\" role=\"status\"></div></form><p class=\"account-switch\">Remembered it? <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/sign-in/\"><span>Back to sign in</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></p><p class=\"account-preview\">Preview only: nothing typed here is stored or sent. <a href=\"/common-ground/\">Use the live Common Ground</a> for your account.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-invitation\"><h2>Stay curious.<br/><span>Grow together.</span></h2><p>Rooted in the Philippines.<br/>Open to the world.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Explore Mycelium\" class=\"footer-destinations\"><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Browse Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Watch videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Find a course</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>View Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></nav></div><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"footer-wordmark\" href=\"/\"><s